Maricha roamed Dandaka elephant-strong devouring sage flesh --- Frightened Vishvamitra sought Dasharatha for Rama guard --- Dasharatha offered own army for under-sixteen untrained Rama --- Vishvamitra insisted only Rama suffices and took boy --- Maricha scorned boy moonlike bowman and rushed altar --- Rama loosed sharp foe-destroying arrow --- Arrow hurled senseless Maricha into hundred-league ocean --- Maricha revived and returned to Lanka spared helpers slain --- Maricha foretells Lanka burnt widowed shelterless rakshasas --- Maricha bids enjoy own wives and shun Rama doom